stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Backlog : /factory next picks the first unchecked item
    Backlog --> Spec : specwriter (Opus) writes spec.md
    Spec --> Build : builder (Opus) builds on factory/JOB-ID
    Build --> Review : 4 reviewers run in parallel
    Review --> Build : CHANGES - orchestrator resumes builder (max 2 resumes)
    Review --> Approve : all 4 reviews PASS
    Approve --> Merged : approver says MERGE - merge --no-ff into main
    Approve --> NeedsHuman : approver says ESCALATE
    NeedsHuman --> Merged : /factory approve JOB-ID
    NeedsHuman --> Build : /factory rework JOB-ID "note" - a new builder round
    Merged --> [*]

